A||||0||WPFC [Ken S.]||Pgh. Vintage Grand Prix Car Show on 7/21||||1||
Z||000000||WPFC [Ken S.]||07-11-2001||05:54 PM||||Hey all,<P>Anyone within reasonable driving distance of Pittsburgh, PA is welcome to join the Western PA Fiero Club at the annual Pittsburgh Vintage Grand Prix Car Show on July 21st.  The show is open to all makes and models, and hundreds of cars fill Schenley Park near downtown Pittsburgh every year.  <P>There will be a dedicated Fiero section (at a prime location where you can easily see the Vintage racers qualify all day long) since we have teamed up with the Pittsburgh Thunderbird Club to get a decent spot (lots of shade also if needed).  <P>There should be a nice trophy given for the best Fiero (this is not handled by the club, but is judged and given by the race organizers themselves).  <P>More info can be found at the following site:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.pvgpa.org/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.pvgpa.org/</A> <P>And the event schedule can be found at:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.pvgpa.org/2001/htm/WelcomeSched.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.pvgpa.org/2001/htm/WelcomeSched.html</A> <P>Any more details will be posted as I recieve them....<P>Ken S.<BR>Western PA Fiero Club Secretary <BR><A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>http://www.westpennfiero.org</A> <p>[This message has been edited by WPFC [Ken S.] (edited 07-11-2001).]||||reg||1
